SUMMARY:Presentation: Spring in the Garden: Getting Your Garden Ready to Grow\, Steeles Library
DESCRIPTION:Spring is the most exciting time in the garden. The possibilities are endless – new pollinator plants\, new containers to design\, finding just the right plant that’s going to give you that one perfect tomato. Join us – let’s find out how to make these possibilities a reality and enjoy the best season ever!
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/presentation-spring-in-the-garden-getting-your-garden-ready-to-grow-steeles-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Steeles Branch\, 375 Bamburgh Cir C107\, Scarborough\, Ontario\, M1W 3Y1
END:VEVENT
