BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Master Gardeners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260512T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260512T200000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232626
CREATED:20260320T220305Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T004354Z
UID:41941-1778612400-1778616000@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:Presentation: Native Plants: Why You Need Them… & They Need You! Morningside Library
DESCRIPTION:Native plant gardens have been trending and are now all the rage. Do you know why? Native plants are best adapted to our local environments\, allowing them to thrive in our climatic conditions\, supporting biodiversity by providing food and shelter for birds and pollinators [while enhancing the beauty of our gardens]. You have everything to gain and nothing to lose by adding more native plants to your garden… come and learn how. \n 
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/presentation-native-plants-why-you-need-them-they-need-you-morningside-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Morningside\, 4279 Lawrence Ave E\, Scarborough\, Ontario\, M1E 2S8\, Canada
END:VEVENT
